msgstr "**DAC** — 透過 :class:`pyb.DAC`\\ 。8 位元的數值涵蓋 0–3.3 V::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-pure-thermal.rst:683
msgid "In ADC or DAC mode P6 is **3.3 V tolerant only — do not feed it 5 V**."
msgstr "在 ADC 或 DAC 模式下，P6 **僅耐受 3.3 V — 請勿對它輸入 5 V**\\ 。"

